# ============================================================================
#  .gitignore - GitHub carries the PLAYABLE GAME ONLY (index.html + the runtime
#  Maps/ image assets it loads + Pictures/). Everything below is work-in-progress:
#  the map-making pipeline, its sources and intermediates, versioned dev builds,
#  and diagnostics. It all lives in the main "Silk Road" working folder; it is
#  kept locally but never published. (Oxus 8/12, per Kris.)
# ============================================================================

# --- internal reference docs (kept local) ---
CHANGELOG.md
COPILOT_ONBOARDING.md
MAP_NOTES.md
Maps/MAP_NOTES.md
NOTES_1271_expansion.md
NOTES_economy_radial.md

# --- versioned dev / playtest builds ---
Silk_Road_v*.html
index_v*.html

# --- python caches / numpy dumps ---
__pycache__/
Maps/__pycache__/
*.pyc
Maps/*.npy
Maps/*.npz

# --- map-making PIPELINE (scripts + intermediate data) ---
Maps/*.py
Maps/*.json
tools/

# --- DEM tiles + baked master rasters (hundreds of MB of build source) ---
Maps/work/
Maps/master1271/
Maps/master_amber/
Maps/ne_lakes/

# --- diagnostic / preview / seasonal-source renders (NOT the game chart assets) ---
Maps/_*.png
Maps/*_spring.png
Maps/*_summer.png
Maps/*_autumn.png
Maps/*_winter.png

# --- scratch / temp ---
*.tmp
Maps/placeholder.txt
Maps/MAPNOTES.md

